# RSS Environment Variables Template
# Copy this file to .env.rss and fill in your RSS URLs
# NEVER commit .env.rss to Git - it is ignored by .gitignore

# Allowed RSS source environment variables:
# - GEEKPARK_RSS_URL: RSS feed from Geekpark
# - OFFICIAL_AI_RSS_URL: RSS feed from Official AI sources

# Example format (do not fill with real URLs here):
# GEEKPARK_RSS_URL=https://example.com/rss/geekpark
# OFFICIAL_AI_RSS_URL=https://example.com/rss/official-ai

# For smoke test, enable only 1-2 sources at most
# Each source will fetch up to 20 articles max

GEEKPARK_RSS_URL=
OFFICIAL_AI_RSS_URL=